/*
 * bfwatch.ino
 *
 * BudFinder watch MVP for the LILYGO T-Watch S3 Plus.
 * Target library: Xinyuan-LilyGO/LilyGoLib (LVGL 9 build)
 * Target board:   LilyGo T-Watch-S3, correct radio revision selected
 *
 * Included now:
 *   - Battery-first watch face with automatic display-off/light sleep
 *   - Swipe-left app launcher with large touch targets
 *   - Stopwatch that continues while the display sleeps
 *   - Stopwatch laps, interval timer and low-power hardware step counter
 *   - Countdown timer with timer wake plus song/haptic alarm
 *   - Persistent RTC alarm with repeat modes and five-minute snooze
 *   - Persistent alert volume and an embedded, replaceable MP3 alarm
 *   - Session-based GNSS speedometer with max, average and trip distance
 *   - Battery diagnostics and full-white torch
 *   - Manual RTC clock setting
 *   - Guarded TV power-toggle remote for common LG, Samsung and Sony codes
 *   - Manual or scheduled, timeout-limited GNSS fixes
 *   - Cached position plus nearest-shop distance and true bearing
 *   - Full offline strain search with stockist lists and filtered map markers
 *   - Persistent GPS interval, screen timeout and brightness settings
 *   - Optional BMA423 raise-to-wake from light sleep
 *   - GPIO0 custom button returns home and randomises the watch-face shop
 *   - Offline Amsterdam map rendered from JPEG tiles stored in FFat
 *   - Touch panning, three zoom levels and coffeeshop/location overlays
 *   - Time-limited, single-SSID novelty Wi-Fi access point
 *   - Dependency-free USB serial map uploader
 *
 * Deliberately omitted:
 *   - Compass / watch-relative arrow (the watch has no magnetometer)
 *   - Continuous GNSS tracking
 *   - Bluetooth and LoRa
 *
 * Coffeeshop data is generated by generate_watch_data.py.
 */

