// LVGL's streaming JPEG decoder has a 4 KiB work buffer and a deep draw call
// chain. Arduino-ESP32's default 8 KiB loop stack overflows while rendering
// four clipped map tiles, so give the UI task explicit headroom.
SET_LOOP_TASK_STACK_SIZE(20 * 1024);

